    {
      "path": "cover.xml",
      "mimeType": "text/xml",
      "title": "cover.xml",
      "content": "<slide id=\"cover\">\n  <background color=\"background\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"8\" fill=\"accent\"/>\n  <image id=\"cover-image\" x=\"0\" y=\"272\" width=\"1280\" height=\"448\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/cover-clock-blueprint-dd244acfe9f6.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"272\" width=\"1280\" height=\"448\" fill=\"#0C4A7ACC\"/>\n  <text id=\"cover-title\" x=\"60\" y=\"330\" width=\"1120\" height=\"100\" font=\"display\" size=\"58\" color=\"#FFFFFF\" autofit=\"shrink\"><p>Архитектура интерактивного детектива в Telegram</p></text>\n  <text id=\"cover-subtitle\" x=\"60\" y=\"450\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\" font=\"body\" size=\"26\" color=\"#FFFFFF\"><p>Как сценарные данные, webhook и архив улик собираются в игровой цикл</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"60\" y=\"535\" width=\"180\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n  <text id=\"cover-meta\" x=\"60\" y=\"560\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" font=\"caption\" size=\"18\" color=\"#FFFFFF\"><p>«12 дней до полуночи» · Верде-Бей · 12 дел · 20–31 декабря</p></text>\n</slide>"
    },
    {
      "path": "player_flow.xml",
      "mimeType": "text/xml",
      "title": "player_flow.xml",
      "content": "<slide id=\"player_flow\">\n  <background color=\"background\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"8\" fill=\"accent\"/>\n  <text id=\"flow-title\" x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"900\" height=\"60\" font=\"heading\" size=\"38\" color=\"primary\"><p>Игровой цикл игрока</p></text>\n  <text id=\"flow-lead\" x=\"60\" y=\"124\" width=\"1040\" height=\"38\" font=\"body\" size=\"22\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>Дата открывает дело, ответ меняет состояние, а архив сохраняет найденное.</p></text>\n  <image id=\"flow-phone\" x=\"60\" y=\"216\" width=\"260\" height=\"195\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/step-phone-08fbc6f4cbfd.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <image id=\"flow-case\" x=\"360\" y=\"216\" width=\"260\" height=\"195\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/step-case-file-e0929b317d98.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <image id=\"flow-clue\" x=\"660\" y=\"216\" width=\"260\" height=\"195\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/step-clue-85b9e210b4aa.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <image id=\"flow-archive\" x=\"960\" y=\"216\" width=\"260\" height=\"195\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/step-archive-box-8b14248ede52.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"320\" y=\"314\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"620\" y=\"314\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"920\" y=\"314\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <text id=\"flow-step-1\" x=\"60\" y=\"440\" width=\"260\" height=\"126\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">01 · /today</strong></p><p>Календарь выдаёт дело по дате.</p></text>\n  <text id=\"flow-step-2\" x=\"360\" y=\"440\" width=\"260\" height=\"126\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">02 · Дело</strong></p><p>Игрок читает вводную и улику.</p></text>\n  <text id=\"flow-step-3\" x=\"660\" y=\"440\" width=\"260\" height=\"126\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">03 · Ответ</strong></p><p>Подсказки помогают, ошибка не блокирует.</p></text>\n  <text id=\"flow-step-4\" x=\"960\" y=\"440\" width=\"260\" height=\"126\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">04 · Архив</strong></p><p>Пройденное дело остаётся доступным.</p></text>\n  <text id=\"flow-footer\" x=\"60\" y=\"640\" width=\"1160\" height=\"32\" font=\"caption\" size=\"16\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>Reply на сообщение дела связывает ответ с конкретным case_id.</p></text>\n</slide>"
    },
    {
      "path": "architecture.xml",
      "mimeType": "text/xml",
      "title": "architecture.xml",
      "content": "<slide id=\"architecture\">\n  <background color=\"background\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"8\" fill=\"accent\"/>\n  <image id=\"architecture-strip\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"180\" height=\"720\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/arch-server-rack-5bb4082e40ff.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"180\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" fill=\"#F1F6F8E6\"/>\n  <text id=\"architecture-title\" x=\"240\" y=\"60\" width=\"900\" height=\"60\" font=\"heading\" size=\"38\" color=\"primary\"><p>Слои системы и поток обновления</p></text>\n  <text id=\"architecture-subtitle\" x=\"240\" y=\"124\" width=\"900\" height=\"36\" font=\"body\" size=\"21\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>Транзакция фиксирует состояние до внешнего dispatch в Telegram.</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"240\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"130\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\" stroke=\"primary\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"460\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"130\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\" stroke=\"primary\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"680\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"130\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\" stroke=\"primary\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"900\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"130\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\" stroke=\"primary\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"1120\" y=\"210\" width=\"120\" height=\"130\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"primary\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"415\" y=\"275\" width=\"45\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"635\" y=\"275\" width=\"45\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"855\" y=\"275\" width=\"45\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"1075\" y=\"275\" width=\"45\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"130\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\" align=\"center\" anchor=\"middle\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">Telegram</strong></p><p>Webhook</p></text>\n  <text x=\"460\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"130\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\" align=\"center\" anchor=\"middle\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">server.mjs</strong></p><p>секрет · JSON</p></text>\n  <text x=\"680\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"130\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\" align=\"center\" anchor=\"middle\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">processUpdate</strong></p><p>receipt · tx</p></text>\n  <text x=\"900\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"130\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\" align=\"center\" anchor=\"middle\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">engine.mjs</strong></p><p>update → actions</p></text>\n  <text x=\"1120\" y=\"210\" width=\"120\" height=\"130\" font=\"body\" size=\"19\" color=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"center\" anchor=\"middle\"><p><strong>Bot API</strong></p><p>dispatch</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"460\" y=\"430\" width=\"615\" height=\"120\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\" stroke=\"divider\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"485\" y=\"452\" width=\"560\" height=\"80\" font=\"code\" size=\"18\" color=\"body-text\"><p>BEGIN → lock update_id → engine → COMMIT</p><p>                         ↓</p><p>              dispatch → mark delivered</p></text>\n  <text id=\"architecture-note\" x=\"240\" y=\"610\" width=\"900\" height=\"44\" font=\"body\" size=\"22\" color=\"accent-text\"><p><strong>Вывод:</strong> Telegraf не нужен — чистые actions сохраняют контроль над транзакцией.</p></text>\n  <text x=\"1160\" y=\"680\" width=\"70\" height=\"24\" font=\"caption\" size=\"15\" color=\"secondary-text\" align=\"right\"><p>03</p></text>\n</slide>"
    },
    {
      "path": "scenario_data.xml",
      "mimeType": "text/xml",
      "title": "scenario_data.xml",
      "content": "<slide id=\"scenario_data\">\n  <background color=\"background\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"8\" fill=\"accent\"/>\n  <image id=\"scenario-image\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/scenario-index-cards-49fa1ddf3275.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"720\" y=\"0\" width=\"560\" height=\"720\" fill=\"#F1F6F8E6\"/>\n  <text id=\"scenario-title\" x=\"780\" y=\"72\" width=\"440\" height=\"74\" font=\"heading\" size=\"36\" color=\"primary\"><p>Сценарная карта как данные</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"780\" y=\"180\" width=\"440\" height=\"105\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\"/>\n  <text x=\"800\" y=\"195\" width=\"400\" height=\"85\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">Контент · cases.mjs</strong></p><p>Неизменяемый пакет: даты, промпты, улики, подсказки, ответы.</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"1000\" y=\"285\" width=\"0\" height=\"45\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"780\" y=\"330\" width=\"440\" height=\"105\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\"/>\n  <text x=\"800\" y=\"345\" width=\"400\" height=\"85\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">Состояние · PostgreSQL</strong></p><p>Игрок, прогресс по делу, receipts и просмотренные улики.</p></text>\n  <text x=\"780\" y=\"475\" width=\"440\" height=\"34\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"accent-text\"><p><strong>Поля дела</strong></p></text>\n  <text x=\"780\" y=\"515\" width=\"440\" height=\"160\" font=\"code\" size=\"18\" color=\"body-text\"><p>date · prompt · evidence[]</p><p>hints[3] · answerType</p><p>answers · traps</p><p>correct / incorrect / next</p></text>\n  <text x=\"1160\" y=\"680\" width=\"70\" height=\"24\" font=\"caption\" size=\"15\" color=\"secondary-text\" align=\"right\"><p>04</p></text>\n</slide>"
    },
    {
      "path": "archive_states.xml",
      "mimeType": "text/xml",
      "title": "archive_states.xml",
      "content": "<slide id=\"archive_states\">\n  <background color=\"background\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"8\" fill=\"accent\"/>\n  <image id=\"archive-image\" x=\"880\" y=\"150\" width=\"340\" height=\"510\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/archive-cabinet-1a34bba7a51a.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <text id=\"archive-title\" x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"1160\" height=\"60\" font=\"heading\" size=\"38\" color=\"primary\"><p>Архив: навигация и состояния</p></text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"132\" width=\"780\" height=\"42\" font=\"body\" size=\"21\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>/archive · Все / В работе / Решённые · по 6 дел на страницу</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"60\" y=\"205\" width=\"760\" height=\"105\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\" stroke=\"divider\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"85\" y=\"225\" width=\"710\" height=\"70\" font=\"body\" size=\"21\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">Дело</strong> · locked → open → solved</p><p>bot_case_progress: нет строки → in_progress → completed</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"250\" y=\"330\" width=\"130\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"520\" y=\"330\" width=\"130\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"350\" width=\"760\" height=\"30\" font=\"caption\" size=\"17\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>locked                 open                    solved</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"60\" y=\"430\" width=\"760\" height=\"105\" corner-radius=\"8\" fill=\"surface\" stroke=\"divider\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"85\" y=\"450\" width=\"710\" height=\"70\" font=\"body\" size=\"21\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">Улика</strong> · unseen → viewed</p><p>bot_evidence_views хранит факт первого просмотра.</p></text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"575\" width=\"760\" height=\"66\" font=\"code\" size=\"18\" color=\"accent-text\"><p>callback_data: ar:l · ar:c · ar:e</p><p>доступ перепроверяется по БД</p></text>\n  <text x=\"1160\" y=\"680\" width=\"70\" height=\"24\" font=\"caption\" size=\"15\" color=\"secondary-text\" align=\"right\"><p>05</p></text>\n</slide>"
    },
    {
      "path": "case_08.xml",
      "mimeType": "text/xml",
      "title": "case_08.xml",
      "content": "<slide id=\"case_08\">\n  <background color=\"background\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"8\" fill=\"accent\"/>\n  <image id=\"case08-image\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"480\" height=\"720\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/case08-pocket-watch-7f19b083b62b.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"480\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"720\" fill=\"#F1F6F8F2\"/>\n  <text id=\"case08-title\" x=\"540\" y=\"60\" width=\"680\" height=\"68\" font=\"heading\" size=\"36\" color=\"primary\"><p>Карта дела №08 · «Четыре минуты»</p></text>\n  <text x=\"540\" y=\"138\" width=\"640\" height=\"34\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>Выдача 27 декабря · ответ типа чч:мм</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"540\" y=\"195\" width=\"640\" height=\"72\" corner-radius=\"6\" fill=\"surface\"/>\n  <text x=\"560\" y=\"210\" width=\"600\" height=\"52\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">H-3:</strong> камера показывает 23:42, но отстаёт на 4 минуты.</p></text>\n  <text x=\"540\" y=\"305\" width=\"640\" height=\"220\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">01 · Улика</strong> — кадр камеры H-3.</p><p><strong color=\"primary\">02 · Подсказка 1</strong> — сравнить часы и запись.</p><p><strong color=\"primary\">03 · Подсказка 2</strong> — прибавить ровно 4 минуты.</p><p><strong color=\"primary\">04 · Подсказка 3</strong> — ответ не является временем кадра.</p><p><strong color=\"accent-text\">05 · Валидация</strong> — 23:46; 23:42 и 23:38 ловушки.</p><p><strong color=\"primary\">06 · Переход</strong> — дело №09, ворота 23:51:10.</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"540\" y=\"575\" width=\"640\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"divider\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"540\" y=\"600\" width=\"640\" height=\"65\" font=\"caption\" size=\"17\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>Ошибка формата не засчитывается. Кадр опровергает часть алиби,</p><p>но сам по себе не доказывает вину.</p></text>\n  <text x=\"1160\" y=\"680\" width=\"70\" height=\"24\" font=\"caption\" size=\"15\" color=\"secondary-text\" align=\"right\"><p>06</p></text>\n</slide>"
    },
    {
      "path": "data_and_safety.xml",
      "mimeType": "text/xml",
      "title": "data_and_safety.xml",
      "content": "<slide id=\"data_and_safety\">\n  <background color=\"background\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"8\" fill=\"accent\"/>\n  <text id=\"safety-title\" x=\"380\" y=\"56\" width=\"520\" height=\"66\" font=\"heading\" size=\"38\" color=\"primary\" align=\"center\"><p>Прогресс, безопасность и тестирование</p></text>\n  <image id=\"safety-vault\" x=\"150\" y=\"136\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/safety-vault-door-c8015bcea03f.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <image id=\"safety-tests\" x=\"730\" y=\"136\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/safety-test-sheet-01095eaf027b.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"60\" y=\"150\" width=\"70\" height=\"470\" fill=\"#F1F6F8CC\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"600\" y=\"150\" width=\"70\" height=\"470\" fill=\"#F1F6F8CC\"/>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"230\" width=\"50\" height=\"260\" font=\"body\" size=\"19\" color=\"primary\" writing-mode=\"vertical\" align=\"center\"><p>УЖЕ ЕСТЬ</p></text>\n  <text x=\"610\" y=\"230\" width=\"50\" height=\"260\" font=\"body\" size=\"19\" color=\"accent-text\" writing-mode=\"vertical\" align=\"center\"><p>СЛЕДУЮЩИЙ ШАГ</p></text>\n  <text x=\"250\" y=\"656\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\" font=\"caption\" size=\"17\" color=\"primary\" align=\"center\"><p>Граница данных</p></text>\n  <text x=\"830\" y=\"656\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\" font=\"caption\" size=\"17\" color=\"accent-text\" align=\"center\"><p>Проверка контура</p></text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"680\" width=\"1160\" height=\"24\" font=\"caption\" size=\"15\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>PostgreSQL/Supabase · bot_app без DELETE и DDL · RLS · receipts по update_id · 16 unit-тестов · 8 тестов прототипа</p></text>\n</slide>"
    },
    {
      "path": "implementation_plan.xml",
      "mimeType": "text/xml",
      "title": "implementation_plan.xml",
      "content": "<slide id=\"implementation_plan\">\n  <background color=\"background\"/>\n  <shape type=\"rect\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"8\" fill=\"accent\"/>\n  <text id=\"plan-title\" x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"900\" height=\"60\" font=\"heading\" size=\"38\" color=\"primary\"><p>Порядок реализации</p></text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"124\" width=\"1000\" height=\"34\" font=\"body\" size=\"21\" color=\"secondary-text\"><p>Четыре шага переводят прототип в проверяемую production-систему.</p></text>\n  <image id=\"plan-calendar\" x=\"60\" y=\"190\" width=\"260\" height=\"325\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/plan-calendar-d0bfb4b367b0.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <image id=\"plan-data\" x=\"360\" y=\"190\" width=\"260\" height=\"325\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/plan-data-mapping-e24a8c3ccb65.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <image id=\"plan-archive\" x=\"660\" y=\"190\" width=\"260\" height=\"325\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/plan-archive-folders-69f10c88bb07.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <image id=\"plan-tests\" x=\"960\" y=\"190\" width=\"260\" height=\"325\" src=\"D:/projects/christmas-advent-calendar-gta6/manus-slides/telegram-mwukdsiu-216dc051/assets/generated/plan-testing-bench-c6cc27688612.jpg\" fit=\"cover\"/>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"535\" width=\"260\" height=\"100\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">01 · Календарь</strong></p><p>Дела 4–12 и даты 20–31.</p></text>\n  <text x=\"360\" y=\"535\" width=\"260\" height=\"100\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">02 · Контент</strong></p><p>evidence[] и answerType time.</p></text>\n  <text x=\"660\" y=\"535\" width=\"260\" height=\"100\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"primary\">03 · Архив</strong></p><p>callbacks, editMessage, 005.</p></text>\n  <text x=\"960\" y=\"535\" width=\"260\" height=\"100\" font=\"body\" size=\"20\" color=\"body-text\"><p><strong color=\"accent-text\">04 · Доказательство</strong></p><p>12-кейсный симулятор и HTTP/Supabase тест.</p></text>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"320\" y=\"352\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"620\" y=\"352\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <shape type=\"line\" x=\"920\" y=\"352\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\" stroke=\"accent\" stroke-width=\"4\" arrow-end=\"arrow\"/>\n  <text x=\"1160\" y=\"680\" width=\"70\" height=\"24\" font=\"caption\" size=\"15\" color=\"secondary-text\" align=\"right\"><p>08</p></text>\n</slide>"
